  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Somalia Flood Joint Response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Somalia is experiencing the devastating impacts of El Ni&#xf1;o-induced Dyer rainfall season (Oct-Dec 2023). To address the most urgent needs of the flood-affected communities in Baidoa district, WC and WRRS will provide FSL and Shelter/NFI support to 750 affected HHs (4500 people) in 10 IDP sites in Berdale, Horseed, Isha and Howlwadaag areas of Baidoa.</narrative>
  </description>
